        },
        {
          "id": 432146593,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It would probably be better to fix the code, since the warnings will likely become errors in Qt 6. I fixed most of the deprecation warnings in the general Qt code back in May, but didn't touch the QCustomPlot code under the assumption that they would be fixed upstream. That hasn't happened yet and unfortunately the [repository hasn't been updated for a while](https://gitlab.com/DerManu/QCustomPlot). I'll try to schedule some time to fix the QCP warnings soon.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789948913",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
